  "description": "YITAMOTOR factory brand packaging, Each cover is custom-built to ensure precise compatibility with the truck. Made from high-quality, commercial-grade vinyl that will not stretch, fade or crack.\nFitment\n2019-2026 Dodge Ram 1500 New Body Style\nNOTE:\nPlease measure your truck bed size or contact your dealer to confirm the correct model before ordering.\nCab size does not matter as long as you have the correct model and bed size.\nFeatures\nCompatibility: YITAMOTOR soft roll up tonneau cover is compatible with the 5.7ft bed of 2019-2026 Dodge Ram 1500 New Body Style without Rambox, Split Tailgate and Bed Track System.\nQuality That Lasts: Double-layer PVC cover resists tear and abrasion for long-lasting use; Sturdy aluminum framework and side rails work seamlessly with stainless steel clamps to create a strong and secure seal\nPainless Operation: No-drill clamps fasten the tonneau cover rails to your truck bed; Hassle-free installation with instructions and mounting hardware included; Access the entire bed by simply rolling the cover up to bulkhead\nTension & Latch System: Reliable spring latching system pairs with an adjustable tension system to maintain a tight and even fit, preventing the cover from getting wrinkles or folds so you enjoy all-around protection regardless of inclement weather\nWater-Repellent: Arched crossbars are specially designed to enable water flow off the surface, preventing water accumulation and potential damage caused by the extra weight",
